      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0230_chairman_03",
      "hash64": "7A9A986FC1DE8151",
      "text": "어머,\\n챔피언 [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\r\\n이런 곳에서 뵙게 될 줄이야...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
